  "title": "Frontier Nuclear Partners with DISA Technologies to Remediate Legacy Uranium Mine Waste at the Maybell Uranium Project",
  "summary": "Winnipeg, Manitoba–(Newsfile Corp. – July 7, 2026) – Frontier Nuclear and Minerals Inc. (NASDAQ: FNUC) (“Frontier”), a nuclear fuel cycle company, announces that it has signed an agreement with DISA Technologies Inc. (“DISA“) to characterize and remediate legacy uranium mine waste dumps and to recover saleable uranium at Frontier’s 100% owned Maybell uranium project (the […]",
